  "solution": "The given equation is 25 * 15 * 5 * 4 * 16 * 21\n\nLet us go through the options.\n\nOption 1: **÷, ×, +, -, =**\n\nL.H.S \n\n25 ÷ 15 × 5 + 4 - 16 \n\n= 5/3 × 5 + 4 - 16 \n\n= 25/3 + 4 - 16\n\n= 37/3 - 16\n\n= **- 11/3 ****≠ R.H.S**\n\n \n\nOption 2: **+, ×, -, =, ÷**\n\nL.H.S \n\n25 **+** 15 × 5 **-** 4\n\n=25 + 75 - 4\n\n= 100 - 4\n\n= 96\n\nR.H.S \n\n16 **÷ **21\n\n= 0.76\n\n**L.H.S ≠ R.H.S**\n\nOption 3:** -, +, ÷, ×, =**\n\nL.H.S \n\n25 **-** 15 **+** 5 ÷ 4 × 16 \n\n= 25 - 15 **+** 1.25 × 16 \n\n= 25 - 15 **+** 20\n\n= 25 + 5\n\n= 30 ≠ R.H.S\n\n Option 4: +, ÷, ×, -, =\n\n25 **+** 15 **÷** 5 **x **4 **-** 16 = 21\n\n 25 + 3 x 4 - 16 \n\n 25 + 12 - 16 \n\n 37 - 16 \n\n = 21.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **option 4.**",
